# ------------------------------------------------------------- Experiments
# The reported results (logs, figures, summary.md, trained models, GIFs) ARE committed:
# the README and the paper cite them, and they let anyone check the numbers without re-running.
# If the repository gets too large, uncomment the next line to stop tracking trained models
# (they are regenerated by deleting results/tier*/logs/ and re-running the notebook of that tier):
# Tier_*/results/*/models/